<title>USA: Vyrex names Kemper chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>Vyrex names Kemper chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>LA JOLLA, Calif. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vyrex Corp said it has named Steven Kemper as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Kemper replaces John Roth, the company's CFO since its founding in 1991 and a member of the team that took it public.</p>
</text>
